7.1 By submitting a Contribution, in return for TolongLabs reviewing and considering it, you
assign to TolongLabs, by way of present assignment of
existing and future copyright, all copyright and other intellectual property rights in that
Contribution throughout the world, for the full term of those rights.

7.2 If, in any country, that assignment is not effective, you instead grant TolongLabs a
non-exclusive, perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free licence, with the right to
sublicense, to do anything with the Contribution that would otherwise infringe your rights.

7.3 You consent to TolongLabs, its successors, licensees and clients, and anyone it authorises,
modifying, adapting and combining your Contribution. Authors are credited in the AUTHORS file,
and TolongLabs will not present your Contribution as the work of another named person.

7.4 You confirm that each Contribution is your own original work, or that you have the right to
assign it, and that it does not include material owned by an employer or any other person.

7.5 Every person who works on the Work for TolongLabs signs the TolongLabs Contributor Notice
before starting work. That signed notice is the main record of the assignment, and it prevails
over this clause 7 if they differ. This clause 7 applies to anyone who has not signed it.
TolongLabs will not accept a Contribution from a person who has not signed the Contributor
Notice unless the Council decides otherwise.

