## 10. Breach and termination

10.1 Any use of the Work that is not allowed by this licence is not licensed and may infringe
copyright.

10.2 If you breach this licence, all your rights under it end automatically and immediately.
TolongLabs may, in its sole discretion and in writing, reinstate them.

10.3 When your rights end, you must stop using the Work and delete all copies in your
possession or control, and confirm in writing to TolongLabs that you have done so if asked.

10.4 If you, or any organisation you work for or control, start legal proceedings claiming that
the Work infringes any patent, copyright or other right, all your rights under this licence end
immediately.

10.5 TolongLabs may seek every remedy available, including injunctions, damages, an account of
profits and delivery up or destruction of infringing copies. You agree that damages alone may
not be an adequate remedy for a breach of this licence.

10.6 Clauses 3, 7, 8, 10, 12, 13, 14 and 15, and any amount already earned, continue after your
rights under this licence end.

